# A full competition robot (port map used by the example programs):
#   1-6 drive (blue, right side reversed in code)   7 intake (green)
#   8 optical (at the intake)   9 GPS   10 IMU   11 radio
#   12 rotation (2.75" tracking wheel)   13 distance (front)   14 AI Vision
--drive 1,2,3:4,5,6:blue
--motor 7:green --intake 7
--optical 8 --gps 9 --imu 10 --radio 11
--rotation 12:track --distance 13 --aivision 14
--view 8765
